 ## Unreleased
 
+### Source thumbnails architecture - 2026-08-14
+
+#### Added
+
+- Added the non-breaking source-level native-thumbnail rule contract. Existing
+  sources remain enabled by default; a later bounded rendering batch will use
+  the rule for wide Moodle cards and square courseboxes.
+
+#### Documentation
+
+- Documented source-thumbnail inheritance, teacher-image precedence, native
+  fallback, migration safety and the future CCB Transfer boundary.
+
 ### Guide CCB advanced - 2026-08-12
 
 #### Fixed
